{
	"_doc": "Haus 12, ground floor (the player's flat). Coordinates are LOCAL to the district. Entrance hall (NW, wood) with a 2x2 bathroom in its south-west corner (tiled): shower and sink. Kitchen (NE, tiled): stove, fridge and kitchen table. Bedroom (SE, tiled): double bed. Living room (SW, wood): desk with laptop, sofa and TV. Door cells and their neighbours are kept free, and the spawn (50,26) in the hall stays clear. Then (T-0031) the neighbours' flats: Haus 3's ground floor and 14 flats on levels 1 and 2 of Haus 5, 9, 3 and 14, each with a stove, fridge, sink, shower, double bed and sofa, plus (T-0035) a desk with a laptop and a TV for fun and video calls. T-0052: the Kneipe's bar counter and pub tables, Café Wolke's tables and the Altmarkt benches. T-0056: the Späti and Imbiss counters (customers stand south of them; the cells behind stay free for staff) and the cash machine on the Altmarkt. T-0058: the tram shelter at the Altmarkt stop and the Polizeiposten's desk. T-0059: the bar counter moved one row down, so the bartender can stand behind it.",
